Package: salpa
Title: Satellite LiDAR Point Adjustment
Version: 0.0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Narumasa", "Tsutsumida", , "rsnaru.jp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6333-0301"))
Description: Tools for aligning satellite lidar footprints to high-resolution
    digital elevation models using positional correction algorithms. Implements
    Genetic Algorithms (GA), Particle Swarm Optimization (PSO), Whale Optimization
    Algorithm (WOA), and L-BFGS-B to minimize alignment error. Supports multiple
    distance metrics: Euclidean, Manhattan, DTW, Correlation, Area, and Hausdorff.
    Population-based optimizers use fork-safe parallel fitness evaluation via
    mclapply with C++ acceleration for position updates.
